WEBVTT

00:00:00.352 --> 00:00:03.568
Opening a card brings it to the middle of the canvas and unfolds it.

00:00:04.522 --> 00:00:13.090
When the card closes, the view no longer jumps back to where it came from. The card folds into its place and stays in the middle, so it can be seen among the cards around it.

00:00:14.044 --> 00:00:16.679
The canvas stays where you are after a card closes.
